@startuml uml-state-diagram
title LabSense - State Diagram: PC Status

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #3A6EA5
}
hide empty description

state "Available" as Available
state "In Use" as InUse
state "Asleep" as Asleep
state "Maintenance" as Maintenance

[*] --> Available : PC registered
Available -right-> InUse : someone starts\nusing it
InUse -left-> Available : user leaves, or\nno signal for 15 s
Available -left-> Asleep : PC goes\nto sleep
Asleep -right-> Available : PC wakes up
InUse --> Asleep : PC goes to sleep
Available -down-> Maintenance : marked for\nmaintenance
InUse -down-> Maintenance : marked for\nmaintenance
Maintenance -up-> Available : maintenance\ncleared
@enduml
